<?php
return ['domain'=>'aware-wave-oracle','plural-forms'=>'nplurals=1; plural=0;','language'=>'zh_TW','project-id-version'=>'aware-wave-oracle','pot-creation-date'=>'2026-11-22T14:30:18+00:00','po-revision-date'=>'2026-11-22T14:30:18+00:00','messages'=>['AwareWave Oracle'=>'AwareWave 命理','Engine URL (browser) must be an https:// address without query or fragment.'=>'引擎網址（瀏覽器用）必須是 https:// 開頭，且不可帶查詢字串或 #。','Engine URL (server) must be an http(s):// address without query or fragment.'=>'引擎網址（伺服器用）必須是 http:// 或 https:// 開頭，且不可帶查詢字串或 #。','Insufficient permissions.'=>'權限不足。','Engine URL (browser)'=>'引擎網址（瀏覽器用）','Engine URL (server)'=>'引擎網址（伺服器用）','Key ID'=>'金鑰名稱','The name this site is registered under at the engine.'=>'本站在引擎登記時使用的名稱。','Default engine language'=>'預設引擎語言','Language map'=>'語言對照','Tool pages'=>'工具頁面','One per line: tool=page ID. When the embedded tool links to another tool, the visitor goes to that page.'=>'每行一筆：工具=頁面 ID。嵌入的工具連到另一個工具時，訪客會被帶到這個頁面。','Site key'=>'站台金鑰','This site signs its requests to the engine with an Ed25519 key. The private half never leaves this site; register the public key below with the engine under the key ID above.'=>'本站以 Ed25519 金鑰為送往引擎的請求簽章。私鑰只留在本站；請把下方的公鑰以上面的金鑰名稱登記到引擎。','No key yet.'=>'尚未建立金鑰。','I understand the old key stops working until the new public key is registered at the engine.'=>'我了解：新公鑰登記到引擎之前，舊金鑰就會失效。','Rotate key'=>'更換金鑰','Generate key'=>'建立金鑰','Member pseudonyms'=>'會員代號','The engine never sees member IDs or e-mails, only HMAC(salt, user ID). Rotating the salt makes every member look new to the engine (usage limits restart).'=>'引擎看不到會員 ID 或電子郵件，只看到 HMAC(鹽, 使用者 ID)。更換鹽之後，每位會員在引擎看來都是新的（用量限制重新計算）。','Yes, rotate the salt.'=>'是，更換鹽。','Rotate salt'=>'更換鹽','Tools available from the engine'=>'引擎提供的工具','None — check the engine URL.'=>'沒有工具，請檢查引擎網址。','Shortcode:'=>'短碼：','Refresh tool list'=>'重新取得工具清單','Tick the confirmation box to rotate the key.'=>'要更換金鑰，請先勾選確認。','New key created. Register the public key below at the engine.'=>'已建立新金鑰。請把下方公鑰登記到引擎。','Tick the confirmation box to rotate the salt.'=>'要更換鹽，請先勾選確認。','Salt rotated.'=>'已更換鹽。','Tool list refreshed.'=>'已重新取得工具清單。','Choose a tool to embed:'=>'選擇要嵌入的工具：','Embedded tool:'=>'已嵌入的工具：','No tools available — check Settings → AwareWave Oracle.'=>'沒有可用的工具，請到「設定 → AwareWave 命理」檢查。','The tool appears here on the published page.'=>'頁面發佈後，工具會顯示在這裡。','AwareWave Oracle: %s'=>'AwareWave 命理：%s','Embeds the AwareWave divination engine (Zi Wei, BaZi, I Ching, Tarot …) in this site\'s pages with a shortcode or block. Engine address, site key and languages are site settings.'=>'用短碼或區塊把 AwareWave 命理引擎（紫微、八字、易經、塔羅…）嵌進本站頁面。引擎網址、站台金鑰與語言都在本站設定。','Key ID: 2–24 characters, lowercase letters, digits and -, starting with a letter or digit.'=>'金鑰名稱：2–24 個字元，只能用小寫英文字母、數字和 -，開頭須是字母或數字。','Default engine language must be zh-TW or en; en was saved.'=>'預設引擎語言只能是 zh-TW 或 en；已存成 en。','Embedding from another domain is not supported yet; same domain was saved.'=>'目前還不支援從其他網域嵌入；已存成同網域。','These lines were not saved (wrong format, or a language the engine does not have — zh-TW, en): %s'=>'以下幾行沒有儲存（格式不對，或引擎沒有這個語言——只有 zh-TW、en）：%s','TranslatePress language slug /%s/'=>'TranslatePress 語言代稱 /%s/','These addresses start with a path the engine uses (%1$s) and will not reach WordPress: %2$s'=>'以下網址開頭是引擎使用的路徑（%1$s），到不了 WordPress：%2$s','Cross-origin only: the address visitors’ browsers load the embedded tools from, e.g. https://engine.example.com'=>'只有跨網域用：訪客的瀏覽器從這個網址載入嵌入的工具，例如 https://engine.example.com','Address this WordPress server calls the engine at; may be an internal http:// address. Empty: this site’s own address (same-origin) or the browser URL (cross-origin).'=>'本站伺服器呼叫引擎用的網址，可填內部的 http:// 網址。留空：同網域用本站自己的網址，跨網域用瀏覽器用網址。','zh-TW or en. Used when the page language is neither and has no entry below.'=>'zh-TW 或 en。頁面語言兩者都不是、下方也沒有對照時使用。','Optional, one per line: WordPress locale=engine language, e.g. zh_HK=zh-TW. zh_TW and en_* need no entry.'=>'選填，一行一個：WordPress 語系=引擎語言，例如 zh_HK=zh-TW。zh_TW 與 en_* 不用填。','AWORACLE_SITE_KEYPAIR in wp-config.php is not a valid key.'=>'wp-config.php 裡的 AWORACLE_SITE_KEYPAIR 不是有效的金鑰。','The key comes from the AWORACLE_SITE_KEYPAIR constant in wp-config.php; change it there.'=>'金鑰來自 wp-config.php 的 AWORACLE_SITE_KEYPAIR 常數，請到那裡修改。','Settings → AwareWave Oracle'=>'設定 → AwareWave 命理','AwareWave Oracle: members cannot save charts — AWORACLE_DATA_KEY in wp-config.php is not a valid key (base64 of 32 bytes).'=>'AwareWave 命理：會員目前無法存命盤——wp-config.php 裡的 AWORACLE_DATA_KEY 不是有效的金鑰（須為 32 位元組的 base64）。','AwareWave Oracle: members cannot save charts — AWORACLE_DATA_KEY is not set in wp-config.php.'=>'AwareWave 命理：會員目前無法存命盤——wp-config.php 還沒設定 AWORACLE_DATA_KEY。','Member data'=>'會員資料','Members can save their own charts and the people they read for ([aw_oracle_my_charts], [aw_oracle_persons]). Names and birth data are encrypted with a key kept in wp-config.php, never in the database, so database backups hold only ciphertext.'=>'會員可以存自己的命盤，以及為別人排盤時輸入的對象（[aw_oracle_my_charts]、[aw_oracle_persons]）。名字與出生資料用 wp-config.php 裡的金鑰加密，金鑰不進資料庫，所以資料庫備份裡只有密文。','Saving is on.'=>'存檔功能已開啟。','Keep a copy of AWORACLE_DATA_KEY outside this server: without it the saved entries cannot be read.'=>'請把 AWORACLE_DATA_KEY 另存一份在這台主機以外：少了它，已存的資料就讀不出來。','Add this line to wp-config.php above “That’s all, stop editing!”, and keep a copy outside this server:'=>'把這一行加進 wp-config.php 的「That’s all, stop editing!」上方，並另存一份在這台主機以外：','Embedding'=>'嵌入方式','Same domain (recommended): the engine answers under this site’s address at /embed/, /api/, /_next/, /tarot/.'=>'同網域（建議）：引擎在本站網址的 /embed/、/api/、/_next/、/tarot/ 下回應。','Another domain (not supported yet): the engine has its own address; the page and the tool would talk by messages.'=>'其他網域（尚未支援）：引擎有自己的網址，頁面與工具之間要靠訊息溝通。','AwareWave Oracle: use a valid tool name (and, for cross-origin embedding, set the engine URL in Settings → AwareWave Oracle).'=>'AwareWave 命理：請用有效的工具名稱（跨網域嵌入時，另需到「設定 → AwareWave 命理」填引擎網址）。','Saved charts'=>'已存的命盤','Saved people (private compatibility readings)'=>'已存的對象（私人合盤）','Saved at (UTC)'=>'儲存時間（UTC）','Content'=>'內容','Name'=>'名字','Birth (local clock time)'=>'出生（當地鐘錶時間）','Gender'=>'性別','Birthplace'=>'出生地','Log in to save.'=>'登入以儲存。','Your session expired. Reload the page and try again.'=>'登入狀態已過期，請重新整理頁面再試一次。','You can keep up to %d entries here. Delete one first.'=>'這裡最多存 %d 筆，請先刪掉一筆。','Saving is not available on this site yet.'=>'本站目前還不能存檔。','Some fields are missing or not valid.'=>'有欄位沒填或格式不對。','Not found.'=>'找不到。','Log in to save'=>'登入以儲存','Administrators: set the member-data key in Settings → AwareWave Oracle.'=>'管理員：請到「設定 → AwareWave 命理」設定會員資料金鑰。','My charts'=>'我的命盤','People I saved'=>'我存的對象','Only you can see these. Nobody is told that you saved them.'=>'只有你看得到。不會通知任何人你存了他們。','Nothing saved yet.'=>'還沒有存任何資料。','Add'=>'新增','Edit'=>'編輯','Delete'=>'刪除','Delete this entry?'=>'要刪除這一筆嗎？','Save'=>'儲存','Cancel'=>'取消','This entry cannot be opened with the site’s current key. You can delete it.'=>'這一筆無法用本站目前的金鑰開啟，可以刪除。','Something went wrong. Reload the page and try again.'=>'出了點問題，請重新整理頁面再試一次。','Check the highlighted fields.'=>'請檢查標出的欄位。','Calendar'=>'曆法','Solar (Gregorian)'=>'國曆','Lunar'=>'農曆','Leap month'=>'閏月','Birth date (year, month, day)'=>'出生日期（年、月、日）','Birth time, local clock (hour, minute)'=>'出生時間，當地鐘錶時間（時、分）','Year'=>'年','Month'=>'月','Day'=>'日','Hour'=>'時','Minute'=>'分','Male'=>'男','Female'=>'女','Birthplace name'=>'出生地名稱','Latitude (north +)'=>'緯度（北為正）','Longitude (east +)'=>'經度（東為正）','Time zone (e.g. Asia/Taipei)'=>'時區（例如 Asia/Taipei）','Use true solar time'=>'使用真太陽時','Births 23:00–24:00 count as'=>'23:00–24:00 出生算作','the same day'=>'當天','the next day'=>'隔天','AwareWave Oracle: this member has saved charts, but AWORACLE_DATA_KEY is missing or invalid in wp-config.php, so they cannot be exported.'=>'AwareWave 命理：這位會員有已存的命盤，但 wp-config.php 的 AWORACLE_DATA_KEY 沒設或無效，所以無法匯出。','Encrypted; this site’s current key cannot open it (it was saved under another key).'=>'已加密；本站目前的金鑰無法開啟（這筆是用別的金鑰存的）。','Saving is for members of this site.'=>'存檔只開放給本站會員。']];